{"id":"wb-1-89","name":"隆兴寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"隆興寺","text":"隆兴寺是中国现存的年代较早、规模较大且保存完整的佛教寺院之一，位于河北省正定县正定镇城东门里街，又称“正定大佛寺”。中国“十大名寺”之一。1961年列入首批全国重点文物保护单位。现为国家4A级旅游景区。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%9A%86%E8%88%88%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":92021441,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92021441","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b392258ab33e5937298c835d.jpg","title":"The_Manichaean_Hall_03_Longxing_temple.JPG","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Manichaean_Hall_03_Longxing_temple.JPG","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6b/The_Manichaean_Hall_03_Longxing_temple.JPG?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Photo by and (c)2007 David Chen","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"The Manichaean Hall of Longxing temple in Zhengding Hebei,China.","width":320,"height":240}}